Bulk operation for setting or removing LoggingFilter properties. In a POST body, supply a JSON
object in the following shapes. For adding new properties:
```
{
    "apply": [
        {
            "key": "route-group",
            "vals": [
                "config"
            ],
            "lvl": "DEBUG"
        }
    ]
}
```
